OL,3,AIt's been a terrible year for farming,
OL,4,AJeremy Clarkson tells Tory conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeremy Clarkson has said it had been a
OL,7,F"terrible" year for farming due to the
OL,8,Fhot weather, at a surprise appearance
OL,9,Fat the Conservative Party conference in
OL,10,FBirmingham.
OL,12,FThe former Top Gear presenter and star
OL,13,Fof Clarkson's Farm also said farmers
OL,14,Fwere being "attacked" from every angle
OL,15,Fby rising costs, but he was optimistic
OL,16,Fabout the future.
OL,18,FHe was greeted by loud applause from
OL,19,Fthe Tory faithful, but joked that "a
OL,20,Flot of people have come dressed as
OL,21,Fseats, I notice, around the edges
OL,22,Fthere".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
