OL,3,AIt's been a terrible year for farming,
OL,4,AJeremy Clarkson tells Tory conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a question and answer session
OL,7,Falongside land agent Charlie Ireland,
OL,8,Fhe also criticised the economic
OL,9,Fconditions faced by business owners,
OL,10,Fasking: "Why would anybody set up a
OL,11,Fbusiness in this country right now?"
